{"nodes":[{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# Linux文本处理\n\n**模块说明**：grep/sed/awk 三件套 + 正则 + 辅助工具 + 重定向\n\n— 7 个笔记，按学习顺序排列 —","x":-110,"y":-520,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"5"},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10002","type":"file","file":"辅助工具.md","x":-130,"y":-370,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10003","type":"text","text":"辅助工具.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型\n• §1 cut 按列切\n• §2 tr 替换/删除\n• §3 sort 排序\n• §4 uniq 去重\n• §5 wc 统计\n• §6 xargs 构造参数","x":200,"y":-370,"width":380,"height":175},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10004","type":"file","file":"输入输出重定向.md","x":-130,"y":-290,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10005","type":"text","text":"输入输出重定向.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：水管 + 邮局\n• §1 文件描述符\n• §2 stdin/stdout/stderr\n• §3 重定向\n• §4 管道与 tee\n• §5 here doc / here string\n• §6 /dev/null\n• §7 实战：日志收集脚本","x":200,"y":-290,"width":380,"height":200},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10006","type":"file","file":"regex.md","x":-130,"y":-210,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10007","type":"text","text":"regex.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型\n• §1 三大流派\n• §2 普通字符与元字符\n• §3 字符类\n• §4 预定义字符类\n• §5 点号与转义\n• §6 量词\n• §7 锚点\n• §8 分组与反向引用\n• §9 交替与分组捕获\n• §10 三大流派速查表\n• §11 实战 IPv4\n• §12 实战 重复单词\n• §13 速查表\n• §14 易错点\n• §15 面试追问\n• §16 链路\n• §17 进一步阅读","x":200,"y":-210,"width":380,"height":425},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10008","type":"file","file":"grep.md","x":-130,"y":-130,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f10009","type":"text","text":"grep.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：grep = 漏斗筛子\n• §1 三种 grep 家族成员\n• §2 BRE vs ERE vs Fixed 三选一\n• §3 正则元字符速查\n• §4 常用选项\n• §5 实战：日志分析模式\n• §6 与 find/sed/awk 的组合","x":200,"y":-130,"width":380,"height":200},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000a","type":"file","file":"sed.md","x":-130,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000b","type":"text","text":"sed.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：sed = 自动盖章机\n• §1 sed 基础语法\n• §2 地址与命令\n• §3 模式空间与保持空间\n• §4 -i 原地修改\n• §5 实战：批量替换配置","x":200,"y":-50,"width":380,"height":155},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000c","type":"file","file":"awk.md","x":-130,"y":30,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000d","type":"text","text":"awk.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：awk = 流水线加工厂\n• §1 awk 基础语法\n• §2 字段与记录\n• §3 模式与动作\n• §4 BEGIN/END 块\n• §5 变量、数组与函数\n• §6 控制流\n• §7 实战：日志统计与报表","x":200,"y":30,"width":380,"height":200},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000e","type":"file","file":"regex-practice.md","x":-130,"y":110,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000f","type":"text","text":"regex-practice.md\n─────\n• 使用说明\n• 第 1 ~ 12 题","x":200,"y":110,"width":380,"height":85}],"edges":[{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10001","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10002","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10003","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10003","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10004","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10004","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10004","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10005","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10005","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10006","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10006","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10006","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10007","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10007","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10006","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10008","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10008","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10008","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10009","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f10009","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f10008","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000a","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f1000a","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000a","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000b","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f1000b","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000a","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000c","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f1000c","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000c","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000d","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e2b1c1d1e1f1000d","fromNode":"a2b1c1d1e1f1000c","fromSide":"bottom","toNod